# Playwright & End-to-End Test Artifacts
# ------------------------------------------
playwright-report/
playwright-report.xml
playwright-report*.xml
test-results/
playwright/
.auth/
user.json

# ------------------------------------------
# Node.js / Frontend Packages (if applicable)
