bin/
obj/
**/CompiledModels/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
.vs/
TestResults/
*.trx
*.DotSettings.user
*.crash
_ReSharper*/
*.suo

# Claude Code agent worktrees (isolated checkouts for background subagents)
.claude/worktrees/

